{"blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "マフラーはあったかいね〜☺️"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202512/mob95EWiC.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202512/moblCDwOp.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "(歩きながらバレないように撮った)"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "東京はイチョウが多い❄️\nいまは散ってしまって道が黄色です"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202512/mobNmz8NG.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202512/mobkCcBfs.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "少し前、生まれて初めて\n母とクリスマスマーケットに行きました！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "かわいいチュロスがあったので食べました🎄"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202512/mob73dsjl.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "母は私より15センチくらい小さいので、\n撮ってもらうと下からアングルです\n慣れない中いつも写真を撮ってくれます📷"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "最近はどこを見ても街がキラキラしていて幸せです🎄✨"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "クリスマス、好きなんです\n世の中に溢れる幸せがいつもより少し多い気がして"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "☃️"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "12月もみんなが笑顔で過ごせますように！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "今年もあと少しになってきたけれど"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "噛み締めながら過ごそうね☺️"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "写真を見てほしいブログでした！🎄"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "❄️\nhttps://youtu.be/03Xa38nfhGw"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "賀喜遥香"}], "source": "official"}